    - Term: AFTER_WIN
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Here is the fight! Thanks for changing me. You have proven yourself worthy
        to fight in the arena
      - "\u0412\u043E\u0442 \u044D\u0442\u043E \u0431\u043E\u0439! \u0421\u043F\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E \u043F\u043E\u0434\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0438\u043B \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F.
        \u0422\u044B \u0434\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043B, \u0447\u0442\u043E
        \u0434\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0438\u043D \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u043D\u0430 \u0430\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0435"
      - "Hier ist der Kampf! Danke, dass du mich ge\xE4ndert hast. Du hast dich als
        w\xFCrdig erwiesen, in der Arena zu k\xE4mpfen"
      - Ecco la lotta! Grazie per avermi cambiato. Ti sei dimostrato degno di combattere
        nell'arena
      - "Voici le combat ! Merci de m'avoir chang\xE9. Vous avez prouv\xE9 que vous
        \xE9tiez digne de combattre dans l'ar\xE8ne"
      - "Oto walka! Dzi\u0119ki za zmian\u0119 mnie. Udowodni\u0142e\u015B, \u017Ce
        jeste\u015B godny walki na arenie"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: AUTO_BATTLES
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - autofights
      - "\u0430\u0432\u0442\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0438"
      - "Autok\xE4mpfe"
      - combattimenti automatici
      - combats automatiques
      - automatyczne walki
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: AUTO_BUILD_HELP
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Press the auto button to quickly send all cards to the deck
      - "\u041D\u0430\u0436\u043C\u0438 \u043A\u043D\u043E\u043F\u043A\u0443 \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043E,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u0431\u044B\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E \u043E\u0442\u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u043A\u0430\u0440\u0442\u044B \u0432 \u043A\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0434\u0443"
      - "Dr\xFCcken Sie die Auto-Taste, um schnell alle Karten an das Deck zu senden"
      - Premi il pulsante automatico per inviare rapidamente tutte le carte al mazzo
      - Appuyez sur le bouton automatique pour envoyer rapidement toutes les cartes
        au jeu
      - "Naci\u015Bnij przycisk auto, aby szybko wys\u0142a\u0107 wszystkie karty
        do talii"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Achievements
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Achievements
      - "\u0414\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0436\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F"
      - Erfolge
      - Conquiste
      - "R\xE9alisations"
      - "Osi\u0105gni\u0119cia"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: BOMB_HELP
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - New card! Of course! There are always 4 of them for a new round. Use it!
      - "\u041D\u043E\u0432\u0430\u044F \u043A\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0430! \u041A\u043E\u043D\u0435\u0447\u043D\u043E!
        \u0418\u0445 \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u0434\u0430 4 \u043A \u043D\u043E\u0432\u043E\u043C\u0443
        \u0440\u0430\u0443\u043D\u0434\u0443. \u0418\u0441\u043F\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0437\u0443\u0439
        \u0435\u0451!"
      - "Neue Karte! Na sicher! Davon gibt es immer 4 f\xFCr eine neue Runde. Benutze
        sie!"
      - Nuova mappa! Certamente! Ce ne sono sempre 4 per un nuovo round. Usala!
      - "Nouvelle carte ! Bien s\xFBr! Il y en a toujours 4 pour un nouveau tour.
        Utilisez-la !"
      - "Nowa mapa! Oczywi\u015Bcie! Na now\u0105 rund\u0119 zawsze s\u0105 ich 4.
        U\u017Cyj jej!"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: BOSS_DIALOG_LOOSE_TEXT
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Gain strength \nto win next time"
      - "\u041D\u0430\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0439\u0441\u044F \u0441\u0438\u043B
        \n\u0434\u043B\u044F \u043F\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0434\u044B \u0432 \u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044E\u0449\u0438\u0439
        \u0440\u0430\u0437"
      - "Sch\xF6pfen Sie Kraft, \num das n\xE4chste Mal zu gewinnen"
      - "Guadagna forza \nper vincere la prossima volta"
      - "Gagner en force \npour gagner la prochaine fois"
      - "Zyskaj si\u0142\u0119, aby \nnast\u0119pnym razem wygra\u0107"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: BOSS_DIALOG_TEXT
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'And you also get:'
      - "\u0410 \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u0442\u044B \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C:"
      - "Und Sie erhalten au\xDFerdem:"
      - 'E ottieni anche:'
      - "Et vous obtenez \xE9galement :"
      - "A tak\u017Ce otrzymujesz:"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: BOSS_OPEN
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Your victories were noticed by the local leader. He is waiting for you in
        the arena
      - "\u0422\u0432\u043E\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0434\u044B \u0437\u0430\u043C\u0435\u0442\u0438\u043B
        \u043C\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043D\u044B\u0439 \u0433\u043B\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0440\u044C.
        \u041E\u043D \u0436\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u043D\u0430
        \u0430\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0435"
      - "Ihre Siege wurden vom \xF6rtlichen Anf\xFChrer bemerkt. Er wartet in der
        Arena auf dich"
      - Le tue vittorie sono state notate dal leader locale. Ti sta aspettando nell'arena
      - "Vos victoires ont \xE9t\xE9 remarqu\xE9es par le chef local. Il t'attend
        dans l'ar\xE8ne"
      - "Twoje zwyci\u0119stwa zosta\u0142y zauwa\u017Cone przez lokalnego lidera.
        Czeka na ciebie na arenie"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: BRUSH_HELP
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - We have energy left. Let's hit melee.
      - "\u0423 \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u0430\u0441\u044C
        \u044D\u043D\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0438\u044F. \u0414\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0439
        \u0443\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043C \u0431\u043B\u0438\u0436\u043D\u0438\u043C
        \u0431\u043E\u0435\u043C."
      - Wir haben noch Energie. Schlagen wir Nahkampf.
      - "Ci \xE8 rimasta energia. Colpiamo in mischia."
      - "Il nous reste de l'\xE9nergie. Frappons au corps \xE0 corps."
      - "Pozosta\u0142a nam energia. Uderzmy w zwarcie."
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: CHEST_DELIVERED
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Chest delivered to storage
      - "\u0421\u0443\u043D\u0434\u0443\u043A \u0434\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043B\u0435\u043D
        \u0432 \u0445\u0440\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043B\u0438\u0449\u0435"
      - Truhe zum Lager geliefert
      - Cassa consegnata in deposito
      - "Coffre livr\xE9 au stockage"
      - Skrzynia dostarczona do magazynu
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: CHOOSE_CARD
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Choose card
      - "\u0412\u044B\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438 \u043A\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0443"
      - "Karte ausw\xE4hlen"
      - Scegli carta
      - Choisissez la carte
      - "Wybierz kart\u0119"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: DAILY_CHEST
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Daily box
      - "\u0415\u0436\u0435\u0434\u043D\u0435\u0432\u043D\u044B\u0439 \u044F\u0449\u0438\u043A"
      - Tagesbox
      - Scatola giornaliera
      - "Bo\xEEte journali\xE8re"
      - "Pude\u0142ko dzienne"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
