    - Term: EQUIP_PREBATTLE
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Here you can change weapons and baths for combat
      - "\u0417\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044C \u0442\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C
        \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F\u0442\u044C \u043E\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0438\u0435
        \u0438 \u0432\u0430\u043D\u043D\u044B \u0434\u043B\u044F \u0431\u043E\u044F"
      - "Hier k\xF6nnen Sie Waffen und B\xE4der f\xFCr den Kampf wechseln"
      - Qui puoi cambiare armi e bagni per il combattimento
      - Ici, vous pouvez changer d'armes et de bains pour le combat
      - "Tutaj mo\u017Cesz zmieni\u0107 bro\u0144 i \u0142a\u017Anie do walki"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: FIGHT
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Fight
      - "\u0411\u0438\u0442\u0432\u0430"
      - "K\xE4mpfen"
      - Combattimento
      - Lutte
      - Walka
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
