      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Get him!
      - "\u0414\u043E\u0431\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0439 \u0435\u0433\u043E!"
      - Hol ihn dir!
      - Prendilo!
      - Attrape le!
