    - Term: FIRST_BATTLE_CHEST_HELP
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You have collected your first chest, it is already in your storage, but there
        are better chests!
      - "\u0422\u044B \u0441\u043E\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043B \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0439
        \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0432\u044B\u0439 \u0441\u0443\u043D\u0434\u0443\u043A,
        \u043E\u043D \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u0432 \u0445\u0440\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043B\u0438\u0449\u0435,
        \u043D\u043E \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C \u0441\u0443\u043D\u0434\u0443\u043A\u0438
        \u0438 \u043B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435!"
      - Du hast deine erste Truhe eingesammelt, sie befindet sich bereits in deinem
        Lager, aber es gibt bessere Truhen!
      - "Hai raccolto il tuo primo forziere, \xE8 gi\xE0 nel tuo deposito, ma ci
        sono forzieri migliori!"
      - "Vous avez r\xE9cup\xE9r\xE9 votre premier coffre, il est d\xE9j\xE0 dans
        votre r\xE9serve, mais il existe de meilleurs coffres !"
      - "Zebra\u0142e\u015B swoj\u0105 pierwsz\u0105 skrzyni\u0119, jest ju\u017C
        w twoim magazynie, ale s\u0105 lepsze skrzynie!"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: FIRST_BATTLE_MIDDLE_CHEST_HELP
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You can take the big box now or fight for the special box!
      - "\u0422\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C \u0437\u0430\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C
        \u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u043E\u0439 \u044F\u0449\u0438\u043A \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441
        \u043B\u0438\u0431\u043E \u0431\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \u0437\u0430 \u043E\u0441\u043E\u0431\u044B\u0439 \u044F\u0449\u0438\u043A!"
      - "Du kannst jetzt die gro\xDFe Kiste nehmen oder um die Spezialkiste k\xE4mpfen!"
      - Puoi prendere la scatola grande ora o lottare per la scatola speciale!
      - "Vous pouvez prendre la grosse bo\xEEte maintenant ou vous battre pour la
        bo\xEEte sp\xE9ciale\_!"
      - "Mo\u017Cesz teraz wzi\u0105\u0107 du\u017Ce pude\u0142ko lub walczy\u0107
        o specjalne pude\u0142ko!"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: FIRST_CHEST
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - But you need your own weapon collection. Grab the gift and get ready for
        battle!
      - "\u041D\u043E \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u0430 \u0441\u043E\u0431\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043D\u043D\u0430\u044F
        \u043A\u043E\u043B\u043B\u0435\u043A\u0446\u0438\u044F \u043E\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0438\u044F.
        \u041B\u043E\u0432\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0430\u0440\u043E\u043A \u0438
        \u0433\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0432\u044C\u0441\u044F \u043A \u0431\u043E\u044E!"
      - "Aber Sie brauchen eine eigene Waffensammlung. Schnapp dir das Geschenk und
        mach dich bereit f\xFCr den Kampf!"
      - Ma hai bisogno della tua collezione di armi. Prendi il regalo e preparati
        per la battaglia!
      - "Mais vous avez besoin de votre propre collection d'armes. Prenez le cadeau
        et pr\xE9parez-vous pour la bataille\_!"
      - "Ale potrzebujesz w\u0142asnej kolekcji broni. Chwy\u0107 prezent i przygotuj
        si\u0119 do bitwy!"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
