    - Term: MERGE
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You got a duplicate! They can be combined to improve cards. I'll show you
        now
      - "\u0422\u044B \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u043B \u0434\u0443\u0431\u043B\u0438\u043A\u0430\u0442!
        \u0418\u0445 \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u043E\u0431\u044A\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043D\u044F\u0442\u044C,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431 \u0443\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0430\u0442\u044C
        \u043A\u0430\u0440\u0442\u044B. \u0421\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0436\u0443"
      - "Du hast ein Duplikat! Sie k\xF6nnen kombiniert werden, um Karten zu verbessern.
        Ich zeige es dir jetzt"
      - Hai un duplicato! Possono essere combinati per migliorare le carte. te lo
        mostro ora
      - "Vous avez un doublon\_! Ils peuvent \xEAtre combin\xE9s pour am\xE9liorer
        les cartes. je vais te montrer maintenant"
      - "Masz duplikat! Mo\u017Cna je \u0142\u0105czy\u0107, aby ulepsza\u0107 karty.
        poka\u017C\u0119 ci teraz"
      Flags: 000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MERGE_DIALOG_MERGE_INFO
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
