    - Term: MERGE_IN_DIALOG_HELP
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Here you can connect duplicate cards and enhance the characteristics of weapons.
        Try!
      - "\u0417\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044C \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u0441\u043E\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043D\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0434\u0443\u0431\u043B\u0438\u043A\u0430\u0442\u044B \u043A\u0430\u0440\u0442\u044B
        \u0438 \u0443\u0441\u0438\u043B\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0445\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043A\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043A\u0438
        \u043E\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0438\u044F. \u041F\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u0443\u0439!"
      - "Hier k\xF6nnen Sie doppelte Karten verbinden und die Eigenschaften von Waffen
        verbessern. Versuchen!"
      - Qui puoi collegare carte duplicate e migliorare le caratteristiche delle
        armi. Tentativo!
      - "Ici, vous pouvez connecter des cartes en double et am\xE9liorer les caract\xE9ristiques
        des armes. Essayer!"
      - "Tutaj mo\u017Cesz po\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 zduplikowane karty i ulepszy\u0107
        charakterystyk\u0119 broni. Pr\xF3bowa\u0107!"
